       "en": "[[indira-goswami|Indira Goswami]] is widely known by the pen name [[mamoni-raisom-goswami|Mamoni Raisom Goswami]]. She received the Jnanpith for 2000. Her fiction examined social suffering and the lives of people constrained by unequal institutions.",
